From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thisiscamk <100883750+thisiscamk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: power: supply: ti,bq27545-hdq: Add the iPad Air
 (J72) gauge

The iPad Air's BQ27545 (DEVICE_TYPE 0x0545) runs Apple's gauge firmware
like the D11 and D111 gauges. Add its board compatible, with the
generic BQ27545 one as fallback.

[Orchard: from thisiscamk/ipad-air-j72-linux 2a257d6; the identity is
 from code/battery/bq27xxx_battery_hdq_uart.c ("verified
 DEVICE_TYPE0545") and the capacity pairing from
 code/battery/j72-capacity-pairing.patch.]
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: thisiscamk <100883750+thisiscamk@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/power/supply/ti,bq27545-hdq.yaml       | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/ti,bq27545-hdq.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/ti,bq27545-hdq.yaml
index 13433d7d5..9e053cb89 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/ti,bq27545-hdq.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/ti,bq27545-hdq.yaml
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@ description: |
   The BQ27540 and BQ27545 are single-cell fuel gauges which can communicate using the
   Texas Instruments single-wire HDQ protocol. An HDQ device has no 1-Wire
   ROM address, so it is represented as the single child of an HDQ bus.
-  D11 and D111 devices use Apple-specific gauge firmware whose
+  D11, D111 and J72 devices use Apple-specific gauge firmware whose
   charge-remaining register set differs from the generic BQ27545 profile.
 
 allOf:
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - apple,d11-bq27545
               - apple,d111-bq27545
+              - apple,j72-bq27545
           - const: ti,bq27545-hdq
 
   power-supplies:
